# IPv4 Header Fields
| Field              | What it Does                  | Example                     |
| ------------------ | ----------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| Version            | IP version                    | IPv4                        |
| Header Length      | Size of header                | 20 bytes                    |
| Total Length       | Entire packet size            | 1500 bytes                  |
| Identification     | Used when fragmenting packets | 5002                        |
| Flags              | Controls fragmentation        | Don't Fragment              |
| Fragment Offset    | Position of fragment          | 0                           |
| TTL (Time To Live) | Prevents endless looping      | 64                          |
| Protocol           | Next protocol                 | TCP (6), UDP (17), ICMP (1) |
| Header Checksum    | Detects header errors         | Calculated automatically    |
| Source IP          | Sender's address              | 192.168.1.10                |
| Destination IP     | Receiver's address            | 8.8.8.8                     |
| Options            | Rarely used                   | Security options            |

